#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit the settings at the top of `sqd_blocks.toml` as in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Edytuj ustawienia na początku `sqd_blocks.toml` zgodnie z poniższą tabelą.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Parameter | Example | Description |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `python_executable` | `\"~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python\"` | The Python of `~/venv/qcsc-node`, with the hook from [Install the Fulqrum solver on a compute node](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `profile` | `\"slurm\"` | System profile, which is `slurm`, `slurm-gpu`, `miyabi`, `miyabi-gpu`, `fugaku`, or a path to your own file |\n"
"| `solver` | `\"fulqrum\"` | Subspace diagonalizer, which is `fulqrum`, `sbd`, or `dice` |\n"
"| `queue` | `\"normal\"` | Slurm partition of the solver jobs |\n"
"| `project` | `\"my-account\"` | Optional Slurm account (`#SBATCH --account`) |\n"
"| `work_dir` | `\"/shared/work/qcsc-prefect\"` | The value of `QCSC_WORK_DIR`, which holds the job directories |\n"
"| `fulqrum_executable` | `\"~/qcsc-prefect/packages/qcsc-prefect-fulqrum/native/fulqrum/bin/qcsc-fulqrum-solve\"` | The path that you recorded in [Install the Fulqrum solver on a compute node](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `eigensolver` | `\"primme\"` | The Fulqrum sparse solver, `primme` or `scipy`. The example file sets `scipy`. Set `primme` after a `FULQRUM_WITH_PRIMME=1` build |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Parametr | Przykład | Opis |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `python_executable` | `\"~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python\"` | Python z `~/venv/qcsc-node`, z hakiem z [Zainstaluj solver Fulqrum na węźle obliczeniowym](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `profile` | `\"slurm\"` | Profil systemu: `slurm`, `slurm-gpu`, `miyabi`, `miyabi-gpu`, `fugaku` lub ścieżka do własnego pliku |\n"
"| `solver` | `\"fulqrum\"` | Diagonalizator podprzestrzeni: `fulqrum`, `sbd` lub `dice` |\n"
"| `queue` | `\"normal\"` | Partycja Slurm zadań solvera |\n"
"| `project` | `\"my-account\"` | Opcjonalne konto Slurm (`#SBATCH --account`) |\n"
"| `work_dir` | `\"/shared/work/qcsc-prefect\"` | Wartość `QCSC_WORK_DIR`, która zawiera katalogi zadań |\n"
"| `fulqrum_executable` | `\"~/qcsc-prefect/packages/qcsc-prefect-fulqrum/native/fulqrum/bin/qcsc-fulqrum-solve\"` | Ścieżka, którą zapisałeś w [Zainstaluj solver Fulqrum na węźle obliczeniowym](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `eigensolver` | `\"primme\"` | Rzadki solver Fulqrum, `primme` lub `scipy`. Przykładowy plik ustawia `scipy`. Ustaw `primme` po zbudowaniu z `FULQRUM_WITH_PRIMME=1` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keep the following points in mind when you edit the file.\n"
msgstr "Podczas edycji pliku pamiętaj o następujących punktach.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Write the paths out, because the file does not expand environment variables. The `~`\n"
"character works. Keep every top-level key, such as `python_executable`, before the first\n"
"table header.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zapisz ścieżki w całości, ponieważ plik nie rozwija zmiennych środowiskowych. Znak `~`\n"
"działa. Zachowaj każdy klucz najwyższego poziomu, taki jak `python_executable`, przed pierwszym\n"
"nagłówkiem tabeli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `[qrmi]` table needs no change, because the `qrmi-runtime` block supplies the instance\n"
"and the QPU. Set `resource` only to override the backend. The credentials stay in\n"
"`qrmi_config.json`, not in this file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tabela `[qrmi]` nie wymaga zmian, ponieważ blok `qrmi-runtime` dostarcza instancję\n"
"i QPU. Ustaw `resource` tylko po to, by nadpisać backend. Poświadczenia pozostają w\n"
"`qrmi_config.json`, nie w tym pliku.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `slurm` profile holds the scheduler and resource settings of a generic Slurm cluster, and\n"
"any key in your file overrides it. The commented `[sqd_advanced]` table sets the\n"
"`sqd-advanced-settings` block, the commented `[advanced]` table sets block names and timeouts,\n"
"and the table of each solver holds its tuning. To choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs, see\n"
"[Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Profil `slurm` zawiera ustawienia schedulera i zasobów ogólnego klastra Slurm, a\n"
"każdy klucz w Twoim pliku go nadpisuje. Zakomentowana tabela `[sqd_advanced]` ustawia\n"
"blok `sqd-advanced-settings`, zakomentowana tabela `[advanced]` ustawia nazwy bloków i limity czasu,\n"
"a tabela każdego solvera zawiera jego strojenie. Aby wybrać węzły, rangi i wątki zadań solvera, zobacz\n"
"[Dostosowanie rozmiaru diagonalizacji SQD do zasobów HPC](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI job and each solver job have a walltime of 12 hours (`#SBATCH --time`), and the flow waits up to 13\n"
"hours (`timeout_seconds = 46800`) for each job. To change the walltime, set `walltime` at\n"
"the top of the file for the solver jobs, or in the `[qrmi]` table for the QRMI job, for\n"
"example `walltime = \"02:00:00\"`. A shorter walltime can start sooner on a busy cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zadanie QRMI i każde zadanie solvera mają limit czasu 12 godzin (`#SBATCH --time`), a przepływ czeka do 13\n"
"godzin (`timeout_seconds = 46800`) na każde zadanie. Aby zmienić limit czasu, ustaw `walltime` na\n"
"początku pliku dla zadań solvera lub w tabeli `[qrmi]` dla zadania QRMI, na\n"
"przykład `walltime = \"02:00:00\"`. Krótszy limit czasu może pozwolić na wcześniejszy start na zajętym klastrze.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the blocks.\n"
msgstr "Utwórz bloki.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The command saves the blocks in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Polecenie zapisuje bloki wymienione w poniższej tabeli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Block | Role |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Solver set (`cmd-sqd-fulqrum-solver`, `exec-sqd-fulqrum-slurm`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-fulqrum`) | The three layers of the solver jobs |\n"
"| QRMI set (`cmd-sqd-qrmi`, `exec-sqd-qrmi`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-qrmi`) | The three layers of the QRMI sampler job, which requests the QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | A `QrmiRuntimeBlock` (`scheduler = \"slurm\"`) with the Slurm settings of the QRMI set and the instance and backend from `qcsc-qrmi login`. It is the default **QRMI Runtime Block** of the run form |\n"
"| `sqd-fulqrum-solver` | A `FulqrumSolverJob` that wraps the solver set and holds the eigensolver settings |\n"
"| `sqd-advanced-settings` | The **Solver Block** of every run (`fulqrum_solver_job/sqd-fulqrum-solver`), the number of CCSD iterations (**CCSD Restarts**, 10 by default), reset mitigation, and the transpiler settings |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Blok | Rola |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Zestaw solvera (`cmd-sqd-fulqrum-solver`, `exec-sqd-fulqrum-slurm`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-fulqrum`) | Trzy warstwy zadań solvera |\n"
"| Zestaw QRMI (`cmd-sqd-qrmi`, `exec-sqd-qrmi`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-qrmi`) | Trzy warstwy zadania samplera QRMI, które żąda QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | `QrmiRuntimeBlock` (`scheduler = \"slurm\"`) z ustawieniami Slurm zestawu QRMI oraz instancją i backendem z `qcsc-qrmi login`. Jest to domyślny **QRMI Runtime Block** w formularzu uruchomienia |\n"
"| `sqd-fulqrum-solver` | `FulqrumSolverJob`, który opakowuje zestaw solvera i przechowuje ustawienia eigensolvera |\n"
"| `sqd-advanced-settings` | **Solver Block** każdego uruchomienia (`fulqrum_solver_job/sqd-fulqrum-solver`), liczba iteracji CCSD (**CCSD Restarts**, domyślnie 10), łagodzenie resetów oraz ustawienia transpilatora |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add `--dry-run` to print the resolved settings without saving anything. `prefect block ls`\n"
