#, no-wrap
msgid "For a first run without the QPU, set **Quantum Source** to `random`, which runs the solver jobs on uniform random bitstrings. To sample through IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) from the workflow host instead of a Slurm job, save a `QrmiRuntimeBlock` with `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (the `[runtime]` table of `sqd_blocks.toml`, in place of `[qrmi]`), and name it in **QRMI Runtime Block**. This block reads the API key from the `qrmi_config.json` file of the workflow host.\n"
msgstr "Do pierwszego uruchomienia bez QPU ustaw **Quantum Source** na `random`, co uruchamia zadania solvera na jednorodnie losowych ciągach bitów. Aby próbkować przez IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) z hosta workflow zamiast z zadania Slurm, zapisz `QrmiRuntimeBlock` z `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (tabela `[runtime]` w `sqd_blocks.toml`, zamiast `[qrmi]`) i podaj jego nazwę w **QRMI Runtime Block**. Ten blok czyta klucz API z pliku `qrmi_config.json` na hoście workflow.\n"

